From 1da718e296dc8ed516b2a7cbe8cd7c6d4416d858 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jeremy Evans <code@jeremyevans.net>
Date: Thu, 19 Mar 2026 19:40:07 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Assume Tk 8.* code applies to Tk 9.* as well

Remove code for Tk 4.*. Tk 8.0 was released in 1997.

Fixes #81
